# anthropics — analysis corpus, TEXT ONLY
#
# The 93 repos under this tree are CLONES of github.com/anthropics — they are
# the subject of the analysis, not our code. They are re-clonable from
# repositories.json via ./bootstrap.sh, so they are not committed here.
#
# Each pair below excludes a clone's CONTENTS (not the directory itself), which
# is what lets the negation re-include our reel folder inside it -- and which
# also excludes <repo>/.git, stopping git from treating 93 nested repos as
# broken submodules.

# ---- the 93 clones: exclude the source, KEEP our reels ----
